Шаблон виден в шторке оформления (Темы):
A template is visible in the appearance drawer (Themes) only on its dates:
• Halloween — from October 17 to November 2;
• New Year — from December 1 to January 14;
• February 14 — from February 1 to 15.
The rest of the time it is hidden. All can be shown with the “Show all holiday templates” switch, and the applied template always stays visible. When a holiday starts, a notification “A template appeared…” arrives.
